  "description": "<strong>⭐ <em>The Murdér Express </em></strong><em>in London combines the very best of fine dining and comedy theatre. Buckle up and get ready for a journey like no other, with murder-mystery intrigue, a bespoke three-course menu, and 1930s-inspired cocktails!</em><br><br> 😊<strong><em>Check out our family friendly sessions on Saturday's at&nbsp;12:30p.m. and 3:00p.m, and Sunday's at 2:30pm.</em></strong><br><br> 💎Summer Menu -&nbsp;<strong>from April 9th</strong>💎<br><ul><li><strong>Menu:&nbsp;</strong>You can see the full menu <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/127Ojf-2ETXhudMMuIXB55TfvixH37_ip/view\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>here</strong></a><strong>.</strong></li><li>See the <strong>Drinks Journey </strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/196p8yuVl5y4OtB5QcCAJaeGRU3_1y2sl/view\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>here </strong></a>and the <strong>Wine Pairing</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1O9re1tJ0OjYcUMY6DrvaVhI1Qa6DqUNo/view\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>here</strong></a>.</li></ul><strong>👉 </strong><em>You will receive a link in your confirmation email to submit any allergies. If you have purchased tickets separately and wish to be seated together, please use the link in your confirmation email&nbsp;</em><br> 👉<em> For personalised packages, private sessions, group bookings or full buyouts, please visit our </em><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://themurderexpress.com/bethnalgreen/groups/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>website</em></a><br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 🕰️ Travel back in time to the glitz and glamour of London in the Roaring Twenties<br> 🍸 Indulge in some of the best cocktails in town at the stylish ‘Seven Sins’ bar<br> 🍽️ Enjoy a 3-course menu expertly crafted by the celebrated Creative Head Chef&nbsp;<br> 🎭 Become a passenger and immerse yourself in the story unfolding around you<br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br> ⏳ Duration: 2 hours. Doors open 10-15 minutes before ticket time<br> 📍 Location: Funicular Productions - Pedley Street Station, Arch 63, London, E1 5BW<br> 👤 Age requirement: 5+ (5-14 year-olds are only allowed in shows until 8:00 p.m. Anyone under 18 must be accompanied by an adult)<br> ♿ Accessibility: please contact&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:info@funicularproductions.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">info@funicularproductions.com</a>&nbsp;to inform the team if you will be attending in a wheelchair.&nbsp;<br> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://themurderexpress.com/bethnalgreen/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br> 💛&nbsp;Family friendly shows on Saturday's at 12:30p.m. and 3:00p.m.<br> 🎁&nbsp;Why not treat your friends and family to The Murdér Express experience? Check out our <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/181851\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gift card</a><br><br><strong>Description</strong><br> The year is 1937, the height of the British Empire, and Britain’s most famous archeologist, Dr. Errol Earhart, has unearthed the world’s most valuable diamond, the Jewel of the Empire, which is being transported to the Von Cleethorpes estate via Pedley Street station’s, Murdér Express. Along for the journey are a host of new characters, including the dashing Errol Earhart and the mysterious Saskia Selikhov as well as some familiar faces... It’s not long before the diamond is missing, bodies are beginning to pile up and the clock is ticking to catch a killer and recover the Jewel of the Empire.<br><br> We welcome you on board for an incredible murder mystery with a delicious 3 course menu…<br><br> …But remember, all is not as it seems and everybody is a suspect, even you.<br>",
